{"title":"2025 WSMO Speed Round Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_WSMO_Speed_Round_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Charlie has five consecutive integers and chooses one of them. The sum of her four numbers that she did not choose is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78db23e86da8fe319c63bdb5eaf6d3fd8fefa17b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2025$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. What number did she choose? \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_WSMO_Speed_Round_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the five consecutive integers be\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/c/30cdedf1748acb2bd80f752a7a3164383b78e4d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n-2,\\; n-1,\\; n,\\; n+1,\\; n+2\\]\" width=\"231\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Their sum is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/9/419dd5e9536822827471f933b6153c743a0c10c5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(n-2)+(n-1)+n+(n+1)+(n+2)=5n\\]\" width=\"367\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Charlie chooses one number, and the sum of the remaining four numbers is 2025.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/1/1f1e89ee4e8a8876c83f5a861434554544f04112.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5n - \\text{chosen number} = 2025\\]\" width=\"209\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>If the chosen number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bdca93962a2beaffc172ca394e04fe05bd74ffd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, then\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/6/476a96f23a302e6c5d50bd39c6a686ef86043c4c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5n - (n-1) = 2025\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/0/5a095472a020ebe8ee4241153e3bec44bd8a12b3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4n + 1 = 2025\\]\" width=\"110\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/98629cd83e2929df4afe7c650f9fde54e9b43b03.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4n = 2024\\]\" width=\"80\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/0/e606bc64ecebe266a0d302d83183008fec63bcaf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n = 506\\]\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>So the chosen number is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/1/e41c9dc654b664d4e3b0959a5f3d90d4b4196b53.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n-1 = 505\\]\" width=\"92\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the number Charlie chose is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/1/4c10f9688b39f121afd22ae8dc1d477116f7f5c2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{505}\\]\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=~Trashboycan\" title=\"~Trashboycan\">~Trashboycan</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018033658\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 40/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1857/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35281:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018033658 and revision id 280756. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}